{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"无：没有哪一项持续、明显地不如Y；个别段落X的比喻稍多，但高亮、分层和到时出现基本把负担抵消了。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X更容易在几秒内先抓住【放大加亮】的心理转折，再顺着小字感受补上音乐里的具体质地；“到时出现”也避免了还没听到相应音乐就先被一堆词占满视线。它的因果链从想靠近、怕添负担、试探、暴露、害怕失去，到最后不再往回藏，一段接一段能接起来；Y虽然短词很多，但不少彼此重复、抽象或力度过猛，扫屏时更像同时收到许多候选解释，不容易判断这一刻真正该抓哪一个。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5cadf66e-ae65-4162-a599-f22a45c0cdec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T031739828896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.921, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:17:52.752642+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2289f1b7fecb4281000b31c31de7456118a3e2b1bde9db4d4efc207a9551369f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}},